<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />

    <meta
        name="viewport"
        content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover"
    />

    <title>SamPlays — Farewell</title>

    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>

    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Share+Tech+Mono&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <style>

        *, *::before, *::after {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        :root {

            --bg: #0f100f;
            --bg2: #171816;

            --fg: #d1cdc3;
            --fg-soft: #8c887f;
            --fg-faint: #45433e;

            --accent: #8d9d7e;
            --accent-soft: #5a6650;

            --mono: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace;
            --sans: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;

        }

        html {
            font-size: clamp(14px, 0.9vw, 18px);
        }

        html,
        body {
            height: 100%;
        }

        body {

            background: var(--bg);
            color: var(--fg);

            font-family: var(--sans);
            font-weight: 300;

            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;

            min-height: 100dvh;

            overflow-x: hidden;

            padding:
                clamp(1.2rem, 4vw, 3rem)
                clamp(1rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);

            position: relative;

        }

        body::before {

            content: '';

            position: fixed;
            inset: 0;

            pointer-events: none;

            opacity: 0.045;

            background-image:
                url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 256 256' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='n'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.9' numOctaves='4' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");

            background-size: 200px 200px;

            z-index: 100;

        }

        body::after {

            content: '';

            position: fixed;
            inset: 0;

            pointer-events: none;

            background:
                radial-gradient(
                    ellipse at center,
                    transparent 40%,
                    rgba(0,0,0,0.58) 100%
                );

            z-index: 99;

        }

        .scanlines {

            position: fixed;
            inset: 0;

            pointer-events: none;

            background:
                repeating-linear-gradient(
                    to bottom,
                    transparent 0px,
                    transparent 3px,
                    rgba(0,0,0,0.06) 3px,
                    rgba(0,0,0,0.06) 4px
                );

            opacity: 0.6;

            z-index: 98;

        }

        .wrapper {

            width: min(100%, 760px);

            position: relative;
            z-index: 10;

            animation: flicker 8s infinite;

        }

        @keyframes flicker {

            0%, 19%, 21%, 23%, 25%, 54%, 56%, 100% {
                opacity: 1;
            }

            20%, 22%, 24%, 55% {
                opacity: 0.94;
            }

        }

        .topbar {

            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.75rem;

            margin-bottom: clamp(2rem, 7vw, 4rem);

            font-family: var(--mono);
            font-size: clamp(0.62rem, 1vw, 0.72rem);

            letter-spacing: 0.12em;

            color: var(--fg-soft);

        }

        .topbar::before,
        .topbar::after {

            content: '';

            flex: 1;
            height: 1px;

            background: var(--fg-faint);

        }

        .heading {

            font-family: var(--mono);

            font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 6vw, 2.4rem);

            line-height: 1.15;

            letter-spacing: 0.03em;

            margin-bottom: 0.7rem;

            overflow: hidden;
            white-space: nowrap;

            border-right: 2px solid var(--accent);

            width: 0;

            animation:
                typing 1.6s steps(24, end) 0.2s forwards,
                blink 0.7s step-end 1.8s 4,
                hideCaret 0.01s linear 4.8s forwards;

        }

        @keyframes typing {

            from {
                width: 0;
            }

            to {
                width: 100%;
            }

        }

        @keyframes blink {

            50% {
                border-color: transparent;
            }

        }

        @keyframes hideCaret {

            to {
                border-color: transparent;
            }

        }

        .subheading {

            font-family: var(--mono);

            font-size: clamp(0.62rem, 1vw, 0.74rem);

            text-transform: uppercase;

            letter-spacing: 0.16em;

            color: var(--accent-soft);

            margin-bottom: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 3rem);

            opacity: 0;

            animation: fadeUp 0.8s ease 1.7s forwards;

        }

        .message {

            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;

            gap: clamp(1.1rem, 3vw, 1.7rem);

            opacity: 0;

            animation: fadeUp 0.9s ease 2.1s forwards;

        }

        .message p {

            font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 1.5vw, 1.05rem);

            line-height: 1.9;

            color: var(--fg);

            font-weight: 300;

            max-width: 78ch;

        }

        .message em {

            color: var(--accent);

            font-style: normal;

        }

        .divider {

            margin: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 3rem) 0;

            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 1rem;

            opacity: 0;

            animation: fadeUp 0.8s ease 2.5s forwards;

        }

        .divider::before,
        .divider::after {

            content: '';

            flex: 1;
            height: 1px;

            background:
                linear-gradient(
                    to right,
                    transparent,
                    var(--fg-faint)
                );

        }

        .divider::after {

            background:
                linear-gradient(
                    to left,
                    transparent,
                    var(--fg-faint)
                );

        }

        .divider-symbol {

            font-family: var(--mono);

            color: var(--fg-faint);

            font-size: 0.7rem;

            letter-spacing: 0.2em;

        }

        .signoff {

            opacity: 0;

            animation: fadeUp 0.8s ease 2.8s forwards;

        }

        .farewell {

            font-family: var(--mono);

            font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.2rem);

            color: var(--fg-soft);

            letter-spacing: 0.06em;

        }

        .name {

            display: block;

            margin-top: 0.45rem;

            font-family: var(--mono);

            font-size: clamp(0.68rem, 1vw, 0.78rem);

            letter-spacing: 0.14em;

            color: var(--accent-soft);

        }

        .bottombar {

            margin-top: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 4rem);

            padding-top: 1.2rem;

            border-top: 1px solid var(--fg-faint);

            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;

            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 0.8rem;

            font-family: var(--mono);

            font-size: clamp(0.58rem, 1vw, 0.68rem);

            letter-spacing: 0.1em;

            color: var(--fg-faint);

            opacity: 0;

            animation: fadeUp 0.8s ease 3.1s forwards;

        }

        .dot {

            display: inline-block;

            width: 5px;
            height: 5px;

            border-radius: 50%;

            background: var(--accent-soft);

            margin-right: 0.5rem;

            animation: pulse 2.5s ease-in-out infinite;

        }

        @keyframes pulse {

            0%, 100% {
                opacity: 0.35;
            }

            50% {
                opacity: 1;
            }

        }

        @keyframes fadeUp {

            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(10px);
            }

            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }

        }

        @media (min-width: 1600px) {

            .wrapper {
                max-width: 900px;
            }

        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {

            .wrapper {
                max-width: 100%;
            }

            .message p {
                line-height: 1.85;
            }

        }

        @media (max-width: 480px) {

            body {

                justify-content: flex-start;

                padding-top: 3.5rem;
                padding-bottom: 3rem;

            }

            .heading {

                white-space: normal;
                overflow: visible;

                width: auto;

                border-right: none;

                animation:
                    fadeUp 0.9s ease 0.3s forwards;

            }

            .topbar {
                margin-bottom: 2.2rem;
            }

            .subheading {
                margin-bottom: 2rem;
            }

            .message p {
                line-height: 1.8;
            }

            .bottombar {

                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: flex-start;

                text-align: left;

            }

        }

        @media (max-width: 340px) {

            html {
                font-size: 13px;
            }

            .message p {
                line-height: 1.7;
            }

        }

    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <div class="scanlines"></div>

    <div class="wrapper">

        <div class="topbar">
            ARCHIVE TERMINAL
        </div>

        <h1 class="heading">
            SamPlays (2020 to 2026)
        </h1>

        <p class="subheading">
            // final transmission
        </p>

        <div class="message">

            <p>
                If you found this page, thank you.
                Seriously.
            </p>

            <p>
                SamPlays was a huge part of my life for a long time.
                I spent years building things here, changing things,
                deleting things, redesigning everything at 3am,
                obsessing over details nobody would probably notice.
            </p>

            <p>
                But it mattered to me.
                Every update did.
                Every version did.
                Every single person who visited this site did.
            </p>

            <p>
                Looking back now, I realize something strange.
                The person who made all of this does not really exist anymore.
            </p>

            <p>
                That Sam was different.
                Different mindset.
                Different goals.
                Different life.
            </p>

            <p>
                I kept trying to hold onto this place because it felt wrong to let it go.
                Like deleting it would erase a part of myself.
            </p>

            <p>
                But maybe that is the point.
                Some versions of us are not supposed to stay forever.
            </p>

            <p>
                So this is the end.
                Completely.
            </p>

            <p>
                No rebrand.
                No comeback.
                No hidden return later.
            </p>

            <p>
                Just a quiet ending to something that once meant everything to me.
            </p>

        </div>

        <div class="divider">
            <span class="divider-symbol">◈</span>
        </div>

        <div class="signoff">

            <p class="farewell">
                Goodbye.
            </p>

            <span class="name">
                — Samar
            </span>

        </div>

        <div class="bottombar">

            <span>
                <span class="dot"></span>
                samplayshindi.work.gd
            </span>

            <span>
                2020 to 2026 · v2.0.0
            </span>

        </div>

    </div>

</body>
</html>
